WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.125
Turn, and the photograph becomes a shape.

00:02.901 --> 00:05.078
As we turn, a model takes over.

00:05.488 --> 00:12.418
Robert O'Dell and colleagues measured how the gas moves, and found a disc inside a ring tilted almost across it.

00:12.986 --> 00:14.731
This is their reconstruction.
